---
export interface SwitchCaseStudy {
  model: string;
  symptom: string;
  diagnosis: string;
  procedure: string;
  result: string;
  images?: Array<{
    src: string;
    alt: string;
    width: number;
    height: number;
  }>;
}

interface Props {
  items?: SwitchCaseStudy[];
  whatsappHref: string;
}

const { items = [], whatsappHref } = Astro.props;
---

{items.length > 0 ? (
  <div class="switch-cases-grid">
    {items.map((item) => (
      <article class="switch-case-card">
        {item.images && item.images.length > 0 && (
          <div class="switch-case-gallery">
            {item.images.map((image) => (
              <img
                src={image.src}
                alt={image.alt}
                width={image.width}
                height={image.height}
                loading="lazy"
                decoding="async"
              />
            ))}
          </div>
        )}
        <div class="switch-case-copy">
          <span>{item.model}</span>
          <dl>
            <div><dt>Síntoma</dt><dd>{item.symptom}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Diagnóstico</dt><dd>{item.diagnosis}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Procedimiento</dt><dd>{item.procedure}</dd></div>
            <div><dt>Resultado</dt><dd>{item.result}</dd></div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </article>
    ))}
  </div>
) : (
  <div class="switch-case-empty">
    <div class="switch-case-flow" aria-label="Evidencia incluida en el servicio">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-camera" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Estado de ingreso</h3>
        <p>Registramos el modelo, el síntoma reportado y la condición visible antes de desmontar.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-magnifying-glass" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Hallazgo comprobable</h3>
        <p>Documentamos polvo, obstrucciones o desgaste únicamente cuando se observan en tu consola.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Prueba final</h3>
        <p>Registramos el trabajo autorizado y validamos ventilación, carga, controles y estabilidad.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <span class="switch-case-eyebrow">Casos reales, sin contenido inventado</span>
      <h3>Tu mantenimiento puede quedar documentado de principio a fin</h3>
      <p>Este componente está listo para publicar trabajos reales con modelo, síntoma, diagnóstico, fotografías, procedimiento y resultado. No mostramos temperaturas, reparaciones o testimonios que no hayan sido medidos y documentados.</p>
      <a href={whatsappHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Solicitar mantenimiento documentado <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i>
      </a>
    </aside>
  </div>
)}

<style>
  .switch-cases-grid,
  .switch-case-flow {
    display: grid;
    gap: .75rem;
  }

  .switch-case-card,
  .switch-case-empty {
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid #d8e2ee;
    border-radius: 1.15rem;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 46px rgba(7, 31, 58, .07);
  }

  .switch-case-gallery {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 2px;
    background: #d8e2ee;
  }

  .switch-case-gallery img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .switch-case-copy,
  .switch-case-empty > aside {
    padding: clamp(1.1rem, 4vw, 1.7rem);
  }

  .switch-case-copy > span,
  .switch-case-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    margin-bottom: .7rem;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: .07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .switch-case-copy dl {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .switch-case-copy dl div {
    display: grid;
    gap: .25rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #d8e2ee;
    padding: .8rem 0;
  }

  .switch-case-copy :where(dt, dd) {
    margin: 0;
    color: #071f3a;
  }

  .switch-case-copy dt {
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .switch-case-copy dd {
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .switch-case-empty {
    display: grid;
  }

  .switch-case-flow {
    padding: .7rem;
    background: #f4f7fb;
  }

  .switch-case-flow article {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid #d8e2ee;
    border-radius: .9rem;
    padding: 1rem;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .switch-case-flow article > span {
    position: absolute;
    top: .8rem;
    right: .8rem;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Kanit', sans-serif);
    font-size: .72rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .switch-case-flow i {
    display: grid;
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    place-items: center;
    border-radius: .68rem;
    background: #ffe9ec;
    color: #071f3a;
  }

  .switch-case-flow h3,
  .switch-case-empty > aside h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-family: var(--font-heading, 'Kanit', sans-serif);
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .switch-case-empty > aside h3 {
    max-width: 24ch;
    font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 4vw, 2rem);
  }

  .switch-case-flow p,
  .switch-case-empty > aside p {
    margin: .5rem 0 0;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-size: .9rem;
    line-height: 1.62;
  }

  .switch-case-empty > aside a {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: .45rem;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: #071f3a;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .switch-case-empty > aside a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: .2em;
  }

  .switch-case-empty > aside a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid #f59e0b;
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 700px) {
    .switch-cases-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }

    .switch-case-flow {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .switch-case-empty {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(280px, .65fr);
      align-items: stretch;
    }

    .switch-case-empty > aside {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .switch-case-empty * {
      scroll-behavior: auto !important;
    }
  }
</style>
